# jemdoc: menu{menu.jemdoc}{gallery.html}, notime
= Gallery
Photos of the group

We try to take a group photo at least once a year. To add a photo, put the image file into the
+images+ folder of +www+ and copy one of the +figure+ blocks below (there is a ready-to-use
template at the bottom of this file).

~~~
{}{raw}
<div class="gallery">
<figure><img src="images/gallery-1.svg" alt="Group photo 1" /><figcaption>Group retreat, summer 2026.</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img src="images/gallery-2.svg" alt="Group photo 2" /><figcaption>Lab open day, spring 2026.</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img src="images/gallery-3.svg" alt="Group photo 3" /><figcaption>Poster session at EICC 2025.</figcaption></figure>
<figure><img src="images/gallery-4.svg" alt="Group photo 4" /><figcaption>End-of-semester group lunch, 2025.</figcaption></figure>
</div>
~~~

